Package: studyforge
Title: Conversational Experimental Design with Deterministic Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Nirwan", "Tandukar", email = "ntanduk@ncsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An LLM agent that turns a researcher's description of an
    experiment into a structured study specification, asks the questions that
    change the design, and produces randomized layouts, unit audits and
    simulation-based power analyses. The language model only interprets and
    explains; all statistics come from deterministic R code built on
    'agricolae', 'lme4' and 'simr'.
